WEBVTT

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:03.604
start to flex and bend enough
that it causes the rear brake to rub?"

00:08:03.979 --> 00:08:06.857
He said, "Well, disc brakes
need regular adjustments."

00:08:07.566 --> 00:08:10.236
I said, "I know that.

00:08:10.277 --> 00:08:14.114
And in fact, I do my brake adjustments."

00:08:14.114 --> 00:08:16.867
He said, "Oh, well,
then your rotor's bent."

00:08:16.909 --> 00:08:18.661
I said, "Yeah, my rotor is not bent.

00:08:18.661 --> 00:08:20.162
I know a bent rotor."

00:08:20.162 --> 00:08:22.081
With condescension, he said,

00:08:22.122 --> 00:08:23.958
"Well, what do you want me to do?"

00:08:24.542 --> 00:08:27.378
I said, "You could answer my question."

00:08:27.378 --> 00:08:28.879
(Laughter)

00:08:28.921 --> 00:08:31.090
At which point Kyle,
the manager of the shop,